 "_doc": [
  "Starters of the 幻龙星系 quests of the January 2013 client (云端王国, 大地迷城, 海洋幻境, 白夜山), which the",
  "later task/taskdefines keeps with their steps and panels but without TaskStarter rows (and whose rows of the later",
  "scene table tconfig are commented out; tools/gen_tasks.py reads those). The 18 first quests are the ones the era",
  "galaxy panels name (scene/cloudstartaskfinishpanel, activityres/mysticearth|mysticocean/*taskpanel,",
  "taskres/whitenight/whitenighttaskpanel of 2013-01-24); 3362 (whitenight3, resources of 2013-02-07, not in the",
  "25 January manifest) came after and is left out. RECONSTRUCTED: the names (the planet and the quest's first room;",
  "the panels draw the real titles as pictures), the pre-tasks (each planet a chain from the newbie quest 150, as the",
  "other planets' first quests start), type 11 / online 1 / line 1 as the 2012 story quests have, and the areas",
  "40-43 (unused by any other quest). 'opened' is the week the galaxy panel gives the quest's room."
 ],
